--- !u!114 &11400112
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 33dbbdb6f707d9846a5e61bf67613e4e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Node_Welcome_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nodeId: guide_welcome_3
  nodeType: 0
  channel: 0
  speakerId: "안내인"
  dialogueText: "응. 세 번의 대결이 끝나면 지금은 보이지 않는 길이 드러날 거야. 그 끝에서 돌아오는 길도 찾을 수 있을 거고."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  typingSpeed: 0.04
  autoAdvanceDuration: 0
  nextNodeId: guide_end
  trueNextNodeId: 
  falseNextNodeId: 
  choices: []
  condition: {fileID: 0}
  eventActions: []
  cameraRecording: {fileID: 0}
  editorPosition: {x: 1180, y: 520}
--- !u!114 &11400120
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 33dbbdb6f707d9846a5e61bf67613e4e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Node_Secret_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nodeId: guide_secret_1
  nodeType: 0
  channel: 0
  speakerId: "안내인"
  dialogueText: "너, 미아가 말을 꺼내기도 전에 물건이 있는 곳으로 갔지."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  typingSpeed: 0.04
  autoAdvanceDuration: 0
  nextNodeId: guide_secret_2
  trueNextNodeId: 
  falseNextNodeId: 
  choices: []
  condition: {fileID: 0}
  eventActions: []
  cameraRecording: {fileID: 0}
  editorPosition: {x: 620, y: 260}
--- !u!114 &11400121
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 33dbbdb6f707d9846a5e61bf67613e4e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Node_Secret_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nodeId: guide_secret_2
  nodeType: 0
  channel: 0
  speakerId: Protagonist
  dialogueText: "전에 한 번 찾아봤으니까. 그런데 미아는 처음 겪는 일처럼 말했어."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  typingSpeed: 0.04
  autoAdvanceDuration: 0
  nextNodeId: guide_secret_3
  trueNextNodeId: 
  falseNextNodeId: 
  choices: []
  condition: {fileID: 0}
  eventActions: []
  cameraRecording: {fileID: 0}
  editorPosition: {x: 900, y: 260}
--- !u!114 &11400122
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 33dbbdb6f707d9846a5e61bf67613e4e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Node_Secret_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nodeId: guide_secret_3
  nodeType: 0
  channel: 0
  speakerId: "안내인"
  dialogueText: "역시 너도 기억하는구나. 이곳은 끝까지 가면 처음으로 되돌아와. 그래도 겁먹을 필요 없어. 네가 익힌 것과 맺은 인연은 남으니까."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  typingSpeed: 0.04
  autoAdvanceDuration: 0
  nextNodeId: guide_return_observed_event
  trueNextNodeId:
  falseNextNodeId:
  choices: []
